        "created_at": "2013-05-04T03:32:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm curious about the decision to have three Sectors per game. &nbsp;I don't question it, I'm just curious to hear about why three was chosen. &nbsp;What happens if you use two or four or five Sectors? &nbsp;Does the game get too long or too short? &nbsp;Is it too easy or hard for the Opposition to win by overrunning things? &nbsp;Would running a game with more or less Sectors make for a fun variant, or has it pretty much been determined that anything but three isn't much fun?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:15.914Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
