        "id": 62507,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-04T04:06:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I know in early playtesting they were using sectors based on the number of pilots the players were using. As to why exactly it was set to a fixed 3 isn't something i'm sure of. Somethings I think is possibly table space, easier to divide sector cards, and&nbsp;to limit the&nbsp;options as to where they could go.</p>",
