      {
        "id": 62509,
        "name": "Craig",
        "username": "Craig",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-04T11:41:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Full disclosure: I haven't played with anything but three sectors.</p><p>There's a lot going on with three sectors to keep track of. Not only that, but the thinner you spread your ships, the harder the game gets (at least, that's my opinion). It seems that adding another sector not only complicates things significantly more, but it would make things much harder strategically.</p>",
